      "id": "b456578837fa",
      "slug": "cho-thue-5000m2-nha-xuong-kcn-chau-son-ha-nam",
      "url": "https://www.macland.vn/bds-cong-nghiep/cho-thue-5000m2-nha-xuong-kcn-chau-son-ha-nam/",
      "title": "Cho thuê 5000m2 nhà xưởng KCN Châu Sơn, Hà Nam",
      "type": "nha-xuong",
      "date": "2025-03-01T10:34:02+07:00",
      "location": {
        "province": "Phủ Lý",
